Package: sglwqs
Title: Weighted Quantile Sum Regression with Sparse Group Lasso
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Akifumi", "Eguchi", email = "siero5335@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Performs Weighted Quantile Sum (WQS) regression using Sparse Group 
    Lasso for variable selection and weight estimation. Features include:
    bootstrap aggregation for stable weight estimation with stratified resampling
    for binary outcomes, train/validation split for exploratory held-out
    conditional association summaries,
    chemical group-based penalties with flexible grouping structures, automatic 
    dummy coding for categorical covariates, multiple imputation support via mice 
    package with Rubin's rules pooling, parallel processing support, and 
    comprehensive visualization functions.
